My new house is beautiful.
The door of the house is open.
Asha comes near the door.
She softly knocks on the door.
I look at the door.
Asha is standing there.
There are two cups of chai in her hand.
The chai is very hot.
Asha smiles.
She comes inside.
"Welcome to the new house, Maya," she says.
There is a small table in the living room.
Asha places the two cups on the small table.
Now the chai is kept on the small table.
"Thank you, Asha," I say.
She says, "Now it is time for a break."
I sit on the chair.
Asha also sits near me.
I drink the hot chai.
Everything is good in my new house.
